          "system__conversation_history": "{\"x-elevenlabs-history\": true, \"entries\": [{\"role\": \"user\", \"message\": \"Hi, I'm calling because my money got deducted twice for one order, 4,199, two times.\"}, {\"role\": \"agent\", \"message\": \"[empathic] I understand your concern. For your order K R T [slow] six one two seven, zero zero nine eight, for four thousand one hundred ninety-nine rupees, one payment went through and the duplicate payment has already been initiated for an auto-reversal. It will reach your bank within five working days, by Friday ninth October, under refund reference [slow] R F D eight eight two one three.\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"message\": \"The order is, uh, K R T six one two seven zero zero nine eight. I paid by UPI yesterday.\"}, {\"role\": \"agent\", \"message\": \"Yes, I see that. The first U T R ending in [slow] five five nine two went through successfully for the running shoes, while the second U T R ending in [slow] five six one zero failed on our end and is being refunded. You do not need to do anything, and it will be back in your account by Friday ninth October.\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"message\": \"The second transaction reference is four two seven eight one six three zero five six one zero.\"}, {\"role\": \"agent\", \"message\": \"Yes, exactly, that is the duplicate transaction that failed on Kartly's side. The auto-reversal for four thousand one hundred ninety-nine rupees started yesterday, and the refund reference number is [slow] R F D eight eight two one three. It will reflect in your account by Friday ninth October.\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"message\": \"So, by what date exactly will I see it back? My rent is due.\"}, {\"role\": \"agent\", \"message\": \"[empathic] I completely understand your urgency. The money will reach your bank within five working days, by Friday ninth October at the latest. You do not need to take any action or share any details from your side.\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"message\": \"Do you need my UPI PIN or anything to process it faster?\"}, {\"role\": \"agent\", \"message\": \"[serious] No, please never share your U P I P I N or O T P with anyone, as Kartly will never ask for them. The refund is completely automatic and is already on its way. Is there anything else I can help you with today?\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"message\": \"All right. Thanks for your help.\"}, {\"role\": \"agent\", \"message\": \"[happy] You are very welcome. Thank you for calling Kartly, and have a wonderful day ahead!\"}]}",
